cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or toolkit, please cite it as below."
title: "Cassandra — EU/EEA Trusted-List Observatory Dataset"
abstract: >-
  A research dataset and toolkit recording daily structural snapshots, normalized
  representations, and day-over-day structural diffs of national trusted lists published
  under Regulation (EU) No 910/2014 (eIDAS) across EU/EEA jurisdictions. Research-only
  structural observation; not trusted-list validation, signature validation, legal-status
  determination, supervision, or regulated trust-service output.
type: dataset
authors:
